 "strings": {
  "...Preferences?": "",
  "Right, let's start at the top, huh?": "",
  "Well, let's start from the top.": "",
  "For durations, we have 35 minutes for 9,000 yen,\n50 minutes for 13,000 yen, or 65 minutes for 17,000 yen.": "",
  "Let's do 35 minutes?": "",
  "I'll go with the 35 minute one.": "",
  "That will work...": "",
  "Certainly a reasonable choice.": "",
  "Though I'd truthfully suggest staying a little longer.\nEspecially for a first-timer like yourself.": "",
  "Though I'd truthfully suggest a little longer\nfor a first-timer like yourself.": "",
  "Interesting...": "",
  "Ultimately it's your choice, though.\nDon't worry, there's no wrong answer.": "",
  "Let's do 50 minutes?": "",
  "I'll go with the 50 minute one.": "",
  "Ah, the big 5-0.\nOur most popular duration.": "",
  "Not too short, but not too long.\nThe perfect length to soothe your body and mind.": "",
  "Let's do 65 minutes.": "",
  "I'll go with the 65 minute one.": "",
  "That's quite an honor, sir.": "",
  "Your sincere enthusiasm\nwarms my heart, honest.": "",
  "I'd say such enthusiasm deserves only\nthe highest quality of service.": "",
  "You know what? You can have any girl\nyou want, no request charge.": "",
  "Wow, really?": "",
  "And here, this is a little bonus.": "",
  "The service here isn't half bad...": "",
  "Maybe I'll come back later.": "",
  "If you say so.\nSee you next time, sir.": "",
  "Oh crap, I, uh... I'm a little short.\nI better come back later. Sorry.": "",
  "Hold on, I don't have enough.\nSorry about that. I'll uh, be back later.": "",
  "Did you have a specific girl in mind?": "",
  "At the moment we have Yuna-chan, Marin-chan,\nand Kanae-chan.": "",
  "Actually, uh... hold on.": "",
  "Hm? Changed your mind, sir? Just remember,\nyou can't change once the session starts.": "",
  "Hm? Changed your mind, sir?\nMake your choice now—you can't change mid-session.": "",
  "So, we currently have Yuna-chan, Marin-chan,\nand Kanae-chan. Who would you like to see?": "",
  "So, we currently have Yuna-chan, Marin-chan, and Kanae-chan.\nWho would you like to see?": "",
  "I'll go with Yuna-chan.": "",
  "A fine choice, sir.": "",
  "Yuna-chan, then...": "",
  "Something wrong, sir?\nYou wanted Yuna-chan, yes?": "",
  "Yup, Yuna-chan it is.": "",
  "Great. Next you can pick any options\nyou'd like to add. There's quite a few.": "",
  "Of course, sir. Well...\nNext we'll have to determine your preferences.": "",
  "You can discuss those\ndirectly with the girl.": "",
  "You can sort through the options\nwith your partner.": "",
  "What kind of options are we talking?": "",
  "What do you mean, preferences?": "",
  "Oh, all kinds. Although not every girl\nis open to everything, you know.": "",
  "The things you like.\nSome things are off the table for certain girls, though.": "",
  "Lucky for you,\nYuna-chan isn't picky.": "",
  "Thankfully, Yuna-chan's okay with\npretty much anything.": "",
  "Well then,\nlet me show you to your room.": "",
  "Well then, let me show you\nto your room.": "",
  "I'll go with Marin-chan.": "",
  "Marin-chan, then...": "",
  "Something wrong, sir?\nYou wanted Marin-chan, yes?": "",
  "Yup, Marin-chan it is.": "",
  "Oh, all kinds. Although not every\ngirl is open to everything, you know.": "",
  "For example, kissing is a no-go\nwith Marin-chan.": "",
  "Everything else is okay,\nbut she's saving her lips for her future husband.": "",
  "Everything else is okay, but she's saving\nher lips for her future husband.": "",
  "Isn't that just the sweetest?": "",
  "Well then, let me show you to your room.\nRight this way, sir.": "",
  "I'll go with Kanae-chan.": "",
  "Kanae-chan, then...": "",
  "Something wrong, sir?\nYou wanted Kanae-chan, yes?": "",
  "Yup, Kanae-chan it is.": "",
  "All you need to know about Kanae-chan is,\nshe doesn't do blindfolds.": "",
  "...Blindfolds?": "",
  "Blindfolds?": "",
  "Yes, sir. She... had a bad experience\nwith them when she was younger.": "",
  "Sorry to hear that. Guess there have been\nall those murders lately, too.": "",
  "Sorry to hear it. With trauma like that,\nall these murders lately can't be helping.": "",
  "Yes, well... You came here\nto forget all of that, yes?": "",
  "Yes, well... You came here to\nforget all of that, yes?": "",
  "Anyway, let me show you to your room.\nRight this way, sir.": "",
  "Welcome, sir.\nThis is your first time here, yes?": "",
  "Again, for durations, we have 35 minutes for 9,000 yen,\n50 minutes for 13,000 yen, and 65 minutes for 17,000 yen.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Is that the right name...?)</color>": "",
  "Hey. Take a seat.": "",
  "Forgive me if this is rude,\nbut I'll cut right to the chase, my boy.": "",
  "You'll have to excuse my frankness, Tak.\nI'll cut right to the chase.": "",
  "I don't know what's going on between you and Hamura,\nbut there's nothing I can do to help.": "",
  "I don't know what's going on between you and Hamura...\nbut there's nothing I can do to help.": "",
  "What do you mean? You're not even gonna\nhear my side of the story?": "",
  "What do you mean, you can't help?\nYou're not even gonna hear my side?": "",
  "You'd just be wasting your time.": "",
  "Hamura's been bankrolling the family for a while now.\nI get by on the scraps he leaves me. I'm... just a figurehead.": "",
  "Hamura's been bankrolling the family for a while now.\nI get by on his scraps, but... I'm just a figurehead.": "",
  "The clan will do the things\nI ask of them, yes.": "",
  "Make no mistake, the family will\ndo the things I ask of them.": "",
  "But if they had to choose between\nmy orders and Hamura's...": "",
  "Who knows?\nMaybe they would choose not to hear me.": "",
  "How long has it been like this!?": "",
  "Boss, how long has it been like this!?": "",
  "Years. The prime of my career was...\nWell, it ended back when I was raising you.": "",
  "Years. The prime of my career was...\nWell, it ended while I was raising you.": "",
  "If only Kaito were still in the family...\nMaybe things wouldn't have turned out like this.": "",
  "If Kaito had only just stuck around...\nmaybe Hamura couldn't have taken control.": "",
  "We're not done here.": "",
  "Actually, we are.": "",
  "I have a message from\nCaptain Hamura, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I have a message from Captain Hamura,\nYagami-san.": "",
  "He says to go see him right away.": "",
  "He's waiting for you at Café Alps.\nHe... wants to talk.": "",
  "He's waiting for you at Café Alps.\nHe says he wants to talk to you.": "",
  "Fine.\nI'll head over when I feel like it.": "",
  "Don't piss him off, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I suggest you don't piss him off.": "",
  "Unless you wanna lose your eyes too.": "",
  "You might just lose\nthose eyes of yours, too.": "",
  "(Hamura's apparently waiting for me\nat Café Alps.)": "",
  "(Guess it would be bad\nif I didn't show.)": "",
  "Welcome, sir.\nPlease take a seat wherever you'd like.": "",
  "(Wasn't Hamura supposed to\nbe here already?)": "",
  "And don't show your face again until you've got him!\nSearch the whole fucking city if you have to!": "",
  "Don't show your face 'til you've got Tak!\nSearch the whole fucking city if you have to!": "",
  "What, the kid in the mask?\nFind him too, dumbass!": "",
  "What, the kid in the mask...?\nWhat do you think!? Find him too, dumbass!": "",
  "Come on, Kaito-san.\nPick up, pick up. You've gotta hide.": "",
  "Pick up, Kaito-san...\nThe Matsugane Family is out for blood...": "",
  "Where is he...?": "",
  "(Kaito-san better not be back at the office.\nThat's the first place they'll look...!)": "",
  "Yo. Tak.": "",
  "Yo, Tak.": "",
  "Heh. Long time no see, Yagami.": "",
  "Yagami.\nLong time no see.": "",
  "Higashi? Is that you?": "",
  "Is that you...? Higashi?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Higashi from the Matsugane Family.\nHe and Kaito-san were close before Kaito-san got booted.)</color>": "",
  "Said he's here on captain's orders.\nThey've been looking for you.": "",
  "Said he's here on the captain's orders.\nThey've been looking for you.": "",
  "I know. Sounds like he really\ndoesn't want our killer caught.": "",
  "I know. Sounds like he's desperate\nto cover for the Mole.": "",
  "You're not giving up, are you?": "",
  "With how much it's pissing Hamura off?": "",
  "I wouldn't dream of it.": "",
  "Keep your nose out of this, asshole.": "",
  "It's your fault I'm here\ncleaning this shit up.": "",
  "What, something wrong? I thought you were\nall about bein' Hamura's lapdog.": "",
  "Something wrong? Way I heard it,\nyou were all about bein' Hamura's lapdog.": "",
  "I'm willing to do a few tricks\nfor the treats he hands out.": "",
  "He's got the treats,\nso I do his tricks.": "",
  "And hell, he's a better leader\nthan you were... Kaito-aniki.": "",
  "You've got no business\ncalling me that now.": "",
  "Don't call me that.\nI'm not your aniki anymore.": "",
  "I suppose not.": "",
  "Guess you're right.": "",
  "Then take your thugs and go, Higashi.": "",
  "Now take your thugs and go, Higashi.": "",
  "Fine.\nWe can call it here for today.": "",
  "Fine.\nThat's enough for today.": "",
  "Looks like if I wanna fight you...": "",
  "I'll have to be ready to kill you.": "",
  "Looking forward to it.": "",
  "Fine. Looking forward to it.": "",
  "We're done here.\nCome on.": "",
  "Remember what I told you.": "",
  "Yagami here is a ticking time bomb.\nGet rid of him if you wanna survive.": "",
  "Yagami here is like a goddamn disease.\nGet over him if you wanna survive.": "",
  "Damn, Higashi. You're finally looking\nlike a real yakuza these days.": "",
  "Higashi. You're finally looking like\na real yakuza.": "",
  "Whatever, asshole.": "",
  "Tak, think you can tail\nHigashi real quick?": "",
  "Tak.\nCan you tail Higashi for me?": "",
  "If I'm bein' honest... I've been worried\nabout him ever since I left the clan.": "",
  "If I'm bein' honest... I'm worried about him.\nHave been ever since I left the family.": "",
  "Yeah, he's changed a lot.": "",
  "Yeah. He's like a different person...": "",
  "I couldn't tell you what he's been through,\nbut it's pretty clear he's had it rough.": "",
  "Can't argue with you there.\nI barely even recognized him.": "",
  "It's like you said.\nHe's changed a lot.": "",
  "It's just like you said.\nHe's changed.": "",
  "All right. I'm on it.": "",
  "Sure, I'll go after him.": "",
  "Here, lemme pay you.\nIt's the least I can do.": "",
  "You really think I want your money?": "",
  "You think I want your money?": "",
  "Besides. How else am I gonna\nget more dirt on Hamura?": "",
  "Besides. How else am I gonna get\nmore dirt on Hamura?": "",
  "It's Kaito. I have a read on Higashi.\nJust turned right down Nakamichi Street, alone.": "",
  "It's Kaito. I've got a read on Higashi.\nHe's alone right now—just turned right on Nakamichi Street.": "",
  "Right on Nakamichi.\nGot it.": "",
  "Thanks again.": "",
  "(I need to find Higashi...) ": "",
  "(There he is!)": "",
  "(That's definitely not Higashi.\nWhat am I, blind?)": "",
  "(I'll wait here for Higashi\nto start moving.) ": "",
  "This is Kaito.": "",
  "It's Kaito.": "",
  "Higashi went into an arcade\non Park Boulevard. Ring any bells?": "",
  "An arcade?": "",
  "Yeah. Looks like it's called Charles?": "",
  "Oh, that. I used to manage the place.\nGuess the family has him running it now.": "",
  "A yakuza arcade?\nThey have a casino in the back or something?": "",
  "Naw, we just used it for deals every so often.\nIt's pretty much a regular shop. Y'know, for kids.": "",
  "Naw, we just used it for deals every so often.\nOther than that, it's still all family-friendly.": "",
  "Okay. I'll see what I can find.": "",
  "Hey, just a sec.": "",
  "Hey, hold on.": "",
  "It's, uh, pretty tight in there. You're gonna need\nto be covert if you don't want him spotting you.": "",
  "Not much room for brute force in there.\nYou should prolly get a disguise first.": "",
  "Right, I'll change real quick.": "",
  "Makes sense, but what kind...?": "",
  "I was thinking maybe school uniform?\nYou'd blend in perfectly.": "",
  "You do know how old I am, right?": "",
  "You know how old I am, right?": "",
  "Look, you're never gonna get anywhere as a detective\nif you're too embarrassed to dress like a kid.": "",
  "...If you say so.": "",
  "(This should help me blend in over at Charles.\nTime to head back there.)": "",
  "(Wait, I need to put a disguise on first.) ": "",
  "Hey, um...\nThe machine ate my coin.": "",
  "Pipe down, brat.\nCan't you see I'm busy here?": "",
  "Aw, but...": "",
  "I said beat it, kid!": "",
  "Just back the fuck off!": "",
  "Ow!": "",
  "Sorry about that, kid.\nHere, go have some fun.": "",
  "Whoa, really!?\nThanks, mister!": "",
  "Really!?\nThanks, mister!": "",
  "...Heh.": "",
  "(Can't go in looking like this.\nI need to change...) ": "",
  "What do you think you're doing, huh?\nOff limits.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Wouldn't have much to report if I went back to the office now.)</color>": "",
  "I said stay out, asshole!": "",
  "I said, stay out!": "",
  "Higashi-san!\nThis guy's crazy!": "",
  "H-Higashi-san!\nThis guy's outta his fucking mind!": "",
  "Yagami!\nYou followed me, asshole!?": "",
  "Yagami!?\nYou followed me here, asshole!?": "",
  "Wait.\nWhat the hell're you wearing?": "",
  "Wait.\nWhat the hell are you wearing?": "",
  "Let's not worry about that now.": "",
  "Uh, just ignore that for now.": "",
  "So? What do you want?": "",
  "What's this about?\nWhat do you want?": "",
  "Kaito-san's worried\nabout you, you know.": "",
  "Kaito-san's worried about you.": "",
  "Far as he can tell, you're nothing\nlike you were in the old days.": "",
  "You were like a brother to him.\nBut you're not the guy he used to know.": "",
  "Why the fuck would I be?": "",
  "So now I'm the bad guy, huh?": "",
  "And who the fuck cares?\nThis is how the yakuza roll.": "",
  "But who the fuck cares?\nI'm living the yakuza life now.": "",
  "Right.\nExcept it's all a big act, isn't it?": "",
  "Come on.\nWhy not drop the act?": "",
  "I saw you give that kid some cash.\nYou big softie.": "",
  "You weren't so tough in front of that kid.\nI saw the whole thing.": "",
  "Deep down you're the same old Higashi.\nThe one who used to look up to Kaito-san.": "",
  "I know there's a good guy in there somewhere.\nThe one who was proud to call Kaito-san his aniki.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Interesting...": "น่าสนใจ...",
  "Wow, really?": "ว้าว จริงเหรอ?",
  "I suppose not.": "ก็คงอย่างนั้น",
  "Looking forward to it.": "รอไปด้วยเลย",
  "Thanks again.": "ขอบคุณอีกครั้งนะ",
  "Hey, hold on.": "เฮ้ย เดี๋ยวก่อน",
  "Ow!": "โอ๊ย!",
  "...Heh.": "...เหอะ"
 }
}
